  "goodToKnow": "Der Kater is a male cat (tomcat), and also a hangover: Ich habe einen Kater. The hangover meaning probably comes from Katarrh (catarrh), not from the animal. Das Katerfrühstück is a hangover breakfast, traditionally with Rollmops or pickled herring. Die Katerstimmung is the gloomy mood after a big celebration, also used for markets after a boom. Der gestiefelte Kater is Puss in Boots."
